      "text": [
        "377 - وَقَالَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «مَنْ مَاتَ فِي أَحَدِ اَلْحَرَمَيْنِ أَمِنَ مِنَ اَلْفَزَعِ اَلْأَكْبَرِ يَوْمَ اَلْقِيَامَةِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.377 - The Imam (as) said:\n\"Whoever dies in one of the two sanctuaries (Makkah or Madinah) will be safe from the Great Terror on the Day of Resurrection.\""
        ]
      }
